The dungeon data in addon/DungeonMaps/Data.lua and dungeonmaps/data/dungeons.json is made from
Forever Dungeon Routes' data (MIT, Checkov23): see addon/DungeonMaps/LICENSE-ForeverDungeonRoutes.txt.
The picture maps of some Forever dungeons (by Santiago Reyes) are NOT part of this project: the
addon shows them from your own Forever Dungeon Routes install.
